// expects: SGL4021
// Every node pinned (DD-12 §12). Under `fixed` (feat/b5-fixed) each frame's
// top-left is its pin and there is no diagnostic. Under an engine that does
// not honour pins (grid in the pipeline harness; elk) each pinned node is one
// SGL4021: three here, two of them listed in DOWNSTREAM_EXTRA
// (`packages/render-svg/test/pipeline.test.ts`).
@layout: { engine: fixed }
a: { @label: "A", @pin: { x: 0, y: 0 } }
b: { @label: "B", @pin: { x: 200, y: 0 } }
c: { @label: "C", @pin: { x: 100, y: 120 } }
a -> c
b -> c
